{"detail": {"templateUuid": "673c85974aa944d8bd0f69de464ec06a", "projectUuid": "6d1df085519946979f53d1f4c788015a", "name": "《牛来·熊砸·豹拉》", "description": "牛来催化股市暴涨的冲击波打扰到了熟睡中的熊砸，为此产生矛盾，在豹拉的保护下，牛来躲过一劫，但是熊砸决意要摧毁股市的态度波及到了普通股民，豹拉与牛来的携手并未阻止这场股灾，最后熊猫酒仙下场，平衡了股市暴涨暴跌的矛盾，引出股市要想长牛，不得情绪化暴涨暴跌，需要慢牛健康发展，亦如牛来的成长也不可拔苗助长。", "coverUrl": "/assets/4fa29172e08478bf.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/b1418f5acb2c47cf8efa4a0925e6af02/22c00ff9ee15b49bf2e32bc7e5399c048ebb85b7.mp4", "snapshotId": 39649, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 8818334, "ownerUuid": "b1418f5acb2c47cf8efa4a0925e6af02", "avatar": "/assets/66a775d69b77f497.webp", "nickname": "嘿嘿呸呸狒狒", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 20, "tags": [{"id": 1304, "code": "classic_derivative", "tagLabel": "经典衍生", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1304/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3054, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI重制那头牛大赛", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3054/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3056, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-抽象“牛牛”｜爆款短片", "parentTag": 3054, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3054/3056", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "抖音：https://v.douyin.com/chCqAowtR9M/     小红书：https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a8612a20000000028007e0b?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABF6VdDvKYM6mJXMTa6Wr8dvH7twRkRIR04h1fm19F8ow=&xsec_source=pc_share  视频号：https://weixin.qq.com/sph/AlTd7vUhU9", "createAt": "2026年08月20日 05:18", "updateAt": "2026年08月22日 12:27", "publishAt": "2026年08月22日 12:18", "honors": ["📣影响力专项奖📣"], "awardedTag": ["📣影响力专项奖📣"], "playCount": 119, "viewCreationProcessCount": 25, "copyCanvasCount